WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Start with a research copy. Build a basket, try practice, or load a read-only copy of your holdings.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Choose what goes together. Search by name, ticker or scheme code. Check the exact fund plan and option; set a starting budget.

3
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Play with the mix. Type a percentage or move a slider. Lock rows; try equal or shuffled weights. Undo the preceding mix edit.

4
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Ask “what if?”. Choose the assets, enter an assumed price move, then select Apply assumption. Compare its impact.

5
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Give your idea time. Set your return assumptions, monthly contribution, years and inflation. Inspect a year on the chart.

6
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Keep the evidence in view. Select an asset for its stored value and date. Mutual-fund NAV and ETF exchange price are different.

7
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Save the question, not just the number. Sign in to save. Name the experiment, write a note, and compare immutable saved versions.
